flowchart TD
    A([Page loads]) --> B[load() calls GET /billing]
    B --> C{API response}

    C -- success --> D[setData\nsetAllEvents = recentEvents first 20\nsetEventsHasMore\nsetEventsNextCursor = id of oldest row or null]
    C -- error --> E[setError — page-level error banner]

    D --> F{eventsHasMore?}
    F -- false --> G[No Load older button shown\nall events displayed]
    F -- true --> H[Load older button visible\ncursor = id of row 20]

    H --> I([Admin clicks Load older])
    I --> J[loadOlderEvents\nsetLoadingOlder true\nbutton disabled + spinner]
    J --> K[GET /events?beforeId=cursor]
    K --> L{API response}

    L -- success --> M[setAllEvents prev append page.events\nsetEventsHasMore page.hasMore\nsetEventsNextCursor page.nextCursor\nsetLoadingOlder false]
    L -- error --> N[setOlderError\nsetLoadingOlder false\nexisting rows preserved]

    M --> O{page.hasMore?}
    O -- true --> H
    O -- false --> P[Button hidden\nall events now loaded]

    N --> Q[Amber error message shown near button\nLoad older button still visible if eventsHasMore]
    Q --> I
